--[[
    AETHER / CUSTOM UI
    Original Roblox Luau interface framework
    Single-file LocalScript, no third-party UI libraries.

    Features:
    - Custom dark glass visual style with teal/violet accents
    - Responsive scaling and draggable window
    - Sidebar navigation and animated page transitions
    - Toggle, button, slider, dropdown, and section components
    - Minimize and close controls
    - Callbacks for connecting your own game systems

    Put this in a LocalScript under StarterPlayerScripts or StarterGui.
    This is a UI framework/demo. Connect callbacks to your own game logic.
]]

